      "text": "in a MI-24 Hind Russian attack helicopter."
    },
    {
      "s": 9.99,
      "e": 13.99,
      "text": "What this incorporated was us trying different tactics"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.99,
      "e": 17.85,
      "text": "in order to defend ourselves against an attack helicopter"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.85,
      "e": 20.32,
      "text": "that we may see down range, or in theater,"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.32,
      "e": 23.38,
      "text": "or against any type of fire adversary."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.38,
      "e": 25.66,
      "text": "It was multiple hours of briefing,"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.66,
      "e": 28.64,
      "text": "and then as well, after debriefing each flight,"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.64,
      "e": 32.13,
      "text": "which allowed us to prepare for the next day."
    },
    {
      "s": 32.13,
      "e": 34.03,
      "text": "- Reason we're going through for the 55th"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.03,
      "e": 35.72,
      "text": "trying to employ this training is to give us"
    },
    {
      "s": 35.72,
      "e": 38.63,
      "text": "a more realistic perspective"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.63,
      "e": 40.9,
      "text": "of what we could possibly be going up against,"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.9,
      "e": 42.76,
      "text": "and just giving us a better dynamic"
    },
